'''Mbessa (Mbesa)''' is a [[Ring language]] spoken in [[Cameroon]], neighboring [[Kom language (Cameroon)|Kom]], [[Oku language]], [[Noni language]]. Mbessa is the language of the people of Mbessa Kingdom (Fondom) in [[Boyo (department)|Boyo Division]] in the Anglophone North-West Region of [[Cameroon]]. 

